                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi n
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/globe"} globular shapes
              as parametrizing objects rather than manifold diagrams. This can be related to the above discussion as follows. Using Rmk.
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#mdiag_infty"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
