                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi MDiag
                          %mi st
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathsf{MDiag^{st}}
              the category of (‘strictly globular’) manifold diagrams with source/target inclusions as maps, and by
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
